ions. It is designed to be included in an Ansible Role under the `tasks/main.yml` directory. Each task is tagged appropriately to allow selective execution. The playbook ensures that Docker\'s apt repository and keys are managed according to the role\'s requirements, with immediate cache updates triggered by handlers.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'phi4:14b', 'created_at': '2025-10-16T04:03:38.582683454Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 6979630902, 'load_duration': 58352830, 'prompt_eval_count': 555, 'prompt_eval_duration': 227139652, 'eval_count': 525, 'eval_duration': 6693317358, 'model_name': 'phi4:14b'} id='run--ca12b612-fd6b-4ae8-8adf-3eb9e37a7f3c-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 555, 'output_tokens': 525, 'total_tokens': 1080}
