Task 1: Prepare summary
Description Task 1: Run a shell command to retrieve the wide output of all the Kubernetes nodes, including labels, using the rke2's kubectl. The command is only executed on the first host of the rke2_servers_group_name group. The command's output is stored in the nodes_summary variable. The task retries the command up to 5 times if it fails initially.

Task 2: K8s nodes state
Description Task 2: Display the state of the Kubernetes nodes, which was previously retrieved and stored in the nodes_summary variable, using the Ansible debug module.


