Task 2: Install using package
Description Task 2: This task installs HashiCorp products using the package method if the hashicorp_installation_method variable is set to "package". It involves setting up repositories for RedHat/Rocky and Debian systems, installing required packages, and then installing HashiCorp products using their package manager.

Task 3: Install manually
